flowchart TB
    A[Event Delivered] --> B[Compute eventId / businessTxnId / effectId]
    B --> C[Check Schema + Policy]
    C --> D[Check Idempotency Store]
    D --> E{Effect Already Committed?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Emit NO_OP Receipt]
    E -- No --> G[Create IN_PROGRESS]
    G --> H[Execute Side Effect]
    H --> I{External Outcome}
    I -- Success --> J[Mark COMMITTED + Replay Card]
    I -- Failure --> K[Mark FAILED or UNKNOWN + Reconcile]
